@startuml F1.4-D05-sessoes
title F1.4-D05 — Listar sessões + encerrar outra
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Aluno" as Aluno
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "SessionsController" as Ctrl
database "Postgres" as Postgres

Aluno -> WebApp: abre /perfil/seguranca
WebApp -> Jwt: GET /me/sessions
Jwt -> Ctrl: JWT ok
Ctrl -> Postgres: SELECT sessões
Postgres --> Ctrl: lista

note right of Ctrl
  Sessão atual SEM _links.encerrar
  RN-F1.4-04
end note

Ctrl --> WebApp: 200 + _links

Aluno -> WebApp: Encerrar (outra sessão)
WebApp -> Jwt: DELETE /me/sessions/{id}
Jwt -> Ctrl: JWT ok
Ctrl -> Postgres: DELETE\nAND id != currentSessionId
Postgres --> Ctrl: OK
Ctrl --> WebApp: 204
WebApp --> Aluno: remove da lista

@enduml
